<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FAFAF7', padding: '20px 70px 0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 90, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2429' }}>路径切拍：多拍流水化</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#185FA5', marginTop: 12 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 520, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 24, paddingTop: 6, paddingRight: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#185FA5' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2429', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>关键路径过长时，把组合 DAG 切成 N 级</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7280', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>参考 XLS 调度思想，N=1 时走原发射路径，生成代码与基线逐字节一致。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7280', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>Parser 单状态提取是纯布线，切拍无收益——范围上明确排除。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20, paddingTop: 4 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid #D9D9D2', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 20, height: 150 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#185FA5' }}>加权分桶调度</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1F2429', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>布线类节点权重 0，Bin/Mux 为 1，RegRead 为 2；按加权深度均匀切分，所有 Sink 固定末级——读写跨拍冲突结构上不可能。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid #D9D9D2', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 20, height: 150 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#185FA5' }}>声明级编译指示</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1F2429', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>在 control/action 声明上方写 <span style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 13 }}>// p4c: stages=N</span> 即可覆盖全局拍数预算；紧邻生效、孤儿告警、非法值报错。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ border: '1px solid #D9D9D2', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 20, height: 240 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2429' }}>valid 链：一个真 bug 教训</Text>
        <svg width={620} height={130} viewBox='0 0 620 130'>
          <rect x='10' y='20' width='110' height='40' fill='none' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='65' y='46' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>io.valid</text>
          <line x1='120' y1='40' x2='160' y2='40' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
          <rect x='160' y='20' width='110' height='40' fill='#185FA5' />
          <text x='215' y='46' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>RegNext sV1</text>
          <line x1='270' y1='40' x2='310' y2='40' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
          <rect x='310' y='20' width='110' height='40' fill='#185FA5' />
          <text x='365' y='46' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>RegNext sV2</text>
          <line x1='420' y1='40' x2='460' y2='40' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
          <rect x='460' y='20' width='150' height='40' fill='none' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='535' y='46' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>状态写 @ 末级</text>
          <text x='10' y='100' fontSize='13' fill='#6B7280'>✕ RegEnable（en 低时保持旧值 → 链永久锁高 → 末级重复写）  ✓ RegNext 纯延迟线（脉冲逐级传播自动清零）</text>
        </svg>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1F2429', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 6 }}>此坑已被固化为「outValid 恒 1 拍脉宽」回归断言；数据边界寄存器相反保留 RegEnable，数据需保持到被下一级消费。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 30, marginTop: 14, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#185FA5' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#6B7280' }}>P4C</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7280' }}>09 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
